UPSTREAM FORMAT IMPLEMENTATION
-------------------------------
Pantegnos contributors — https://github.com/FrontierTM/Pantegnos
Pinned commit: 1bb2a6743e6d1dc85e9d5e38edad68975ad1fc37
License: GNU AGPL-3.0-only (the current upstream license, not an older MIT version)

The following TypeScript files are ports/adaptations of the format parsing,
white-box table networks, key derivation, and URI mapping in upstream files
internal/modules/impl/npvt.go, npvs.go, npvs_wb.go, npvs_gen2.go,
npvs_gen2_wb.go and npvs_open.go:
  src/core/whitebox.ts
  src/core/npvt.ts
  src/core/npvs.ts
  src/core/convert.ts

Binary format tables in vendor/pantegnos/assets are from that commit, except
npvt_last.bin, which is the tboxesLast array extracted from npvt.go without
changing its values. SHA-256 checksums and provenance are recorded in
vendor/pantegnos/provenance.json. Upstream license is also retained at
vendor/pantegnos/LICENSE. These tables implement a proprietary format; their
inclusion is not an endorsement by the application vendor.

tests/reference/generate.go is a synthetic fixture generator that runs inside
the pinned upstream Go test package. It contains no private user samples.

